@startuml crm-relationship-state
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
title Figure 4.3.8.3.1 CRM Relationship Lifecycle State Diagram
hide empty description
state " " as Entry <<choice>>
[*] --> Entry
Entry --> CONTACTED : createRelationship [new record] / save
Entry --> SHORTLISTED : view lifecycle [existing record has SHORTLISTED]
SHORTLISTED --> CONTACTED : updateStage [ungrouped] / save stage
CONTACTED --> NEGOTIATING : updateStage [ungrouped] / save stage
CONTACTED --> DECLINED : updateStage [ungrouped] / save stage
CONTACTED --> CANCELLED : updateStage [ungrouped] / save stage
NEGOTIATING --> DECLINED : updateStage [ungrouped] / save stage
NEGOTIATING --> CANCELLED : updateStage [ungrouped] / save stage
DECLINED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
note right of CONTACTED
  Scope: standalone CRM stage endpoint.
  SHORTLISTED is accepted as an existing value.
  A grouped relationship follows the Deal workflow (§3.8).
end note
note right of NEGOTIATING
  Blocked: direct CRM confirmation and direct patches
  on active Deal members. Same-stage updates can update nextAction.
end note
@enduml
